OL,3,GNorthern Ireland                       
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start with outbreaks   
OL,6,Fof rain, mainly in the south and east. 
OL,7,FRain easing in the morning to leave a  
OL,8,Fdry afternoon with some brighter       
OL,9,Fspells developing from the north.      
OL,10,FBreezy around the coasts.              
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will be dry through the    
OL,13,Fevening, with cloud clearing to leave  
OL,14,Flargely clear skies.                   
OL,16,CFriday:FAfter a cold and frosty start, 
OL,17,Fit will be a dry day with largely      
OL,18,Fclear skies and plenty of sunshine.    
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
