OL,3,GNorthern Ireland                       
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDry    
OL,6,Fwith some bright or sunny spells on    
OL,7,FSaturday. Breezy and mostly dry on     
OL,8,FSunday but turning cloudier. Monday    
OL,9,Fwill be cloudy with heavy rain at      
OL,10,Ftimes and winds strengthening.         
